sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User / Admin
    participant Client as React Client (Frontend)
    participant API as Express API (/api/auth)
    participant DB as Relational DBMS (users & wallets)

    User->>Client: Enters Email & Password
    Client->>API: POST /api/auth/login { email, password }
    API->>DB: SELECT * FROM users WHERE email = ?
    DB-->>API: User record (including password_hash, role, account_status)
    
    alt User not found or inactive
        API-->>Client: 401 Unauthorized / 403 Suspended
        Client-->>User: Displays error notification
    else Credentials Validated
        API->>API: bcrypt.compare(password, password_hash)
        API->>DB: SELECT * FROM wallets WHERE user_id = ?
        DB-->>API: Wallet record (wallet_number, balance)
        API->>API: jwt.sign({ userId, email, role }, JWT_SECRET, expiresIn='7d')
        API->>DB: INSERT INTO audit_logs (USER_LOGIN)
        API-->>Client: 200 OK { token, user, wallet }
        Client->>Client: Stores token in localStorage & updates AuthContext
        Client-->>User: Redirects to /dashboard (Light Mode default)
    end
